<title>SINGAPORE: Pakistan Telecom obtains loan facility.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Telecom obtains loan facility.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Telecommunications Co Ltd has obtained a US$115.5 million short-term financing facility, joint-arrangers ABN AMRO Bank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell (Singapore) Ltd said on Friday in a statement issued by Deutsche.  </p>
<p>The one year facilty is guaranteed by the State Bank of Pakistan, a Deutsche Morgan Grenfell official said.</p>
<p>It was initially launched and syndicated at $50 million but Deutsche said that due to substantial oversubscription it was increased to $115.5 million.</p>
</text>
